{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52337","headline":"诗（幷序） 九十八 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下恶官职，未过御史台（戴校「寺」）。\n好眉福张眼（戴、项、袁校「努眉复张眼」），何须弄师子。\n傍看甚可畏，自家困求死。\n脱却面头皮，还共人相似。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}